msgid "Most role names are global: ``roles: [administrator]`` means administrator everywhere it is declared. ``APPLICATION_SCOPED_ROLES`` are the exception. Those carry a distinct grant per application, so reading them from the unscoped list would hand a user every deployed application's copy at once. They come only from ``application_roles``::"
