msgid "Rate limiting is not among them. The proxy ships no `limit_req` or `limit_conn` anywhere, so a public MCP endpoint is only as protected as its own authentication and its declared `limits`. An operator exposing one to the open internet has to put a rate limiter in front of the vhost; the platform will not supply one."
