msgid "Step into a secure future with [Keycloak](https://www.keycloak.org/)! This open‐source identity and access management solution offers powerful single sign-on (SSO), multi-factor authentication, and user federation capabilities. With support for industry standards such as SAML and OpenID Connect, Keycloak helps you protect and streamline access to your applications."
