# libretranslate
msgid "Tests that enforce the `test_*.py` prefix convention and the rule that every `test_*.py` file lives under `tests/` and contains at least one runnable `unittest.TestCase`."
msgstr "टेस्ट जो लागू करते हैं `test_*.py` नियम और नियम `test_*.py` फ़ाइल के तहत रहता है `tests/` इसमें कम से कम एक रनेबल है `unittest.TestCase`।."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests that only assert that a file contains a string, task name, variable name, or template fragment are not allowed."
