# libretranslate
msgid "The journey is covered bespoke in `files/playwright/test-sso-login.js`, which seeds the landing flag, clicks the GitLab-slot link, verifies the channel view, and signs out via `/logout`; `files/playwright/test-biber-dm-administrator.js` adds the peer exchange. The path back to the generic personas is an SSO control whose accessible name matches the shared matcher."
msgstr "यात्रा में शामिल है `files/playwright/test-sso-login.js`, जो लैंडिंग ध्वज को बीज देता है, क्लिक करता है GitLab-स्लॉट लिंक, चैनल व्यू को सत्यापित करता है, और इसके माध्यम से संकेत करता है `/logout`; `files/playwright/test-biber-dm-administrator.js` साथियों का विनिमय जोड़ता है। जेनेरिक व्यक्तित्व के लिए वापस पथ एक एसएसओ नियंत्रण है जिसका सुलभ नाम साझा मैचर से मेल खाता है।."

# libretranslate
msgid "The journey itself is not dropped. [`files/playwright/test-admin-native.js`](./files/playwright/test-admin-native.js) drives it through Shopware's own selectors: an authenticated backend assertion, then logout through the user-actions toggle and back to the login form. `SSO_SERVICE_ENABLED` selects how it signs in — through the `a.heptacom-admin-open-auth--button` provider link that AdminOpenAuth appends into `.sw-login__content` when SSO is on, through the native password form when it is off. The `guest` persona and the role-local reachability, TLS and HSTS assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "स्वयं यात्रा नहीं हुई। [`files/playwright/test-admin-native.js`](./files/playwright/test-admin-native.js) इसके माध्यम से ड्राइव Shopware'अपने चयनकर्ता: एक प्रमाणित बैकएंड रिवोल्यूशन, फिर उपयोगकर्ता-क्रियाओं के माध्यम से लॉगआउट करें और लॉगिन फॉर्म में वापस जाएं। `SSO_SERVICE_ENABLED` यह कैसे संकेत करता है - के माध्यम से `a.heptacom-admin-open-auth--button` प्रदाता लिंक कि AdminOpenAuth में appends `.sw-login__content` जब यह बंद हो जाता है तो SSO मूल पासवर्ड फॉर्म के माध्यम से होता है। The The most of the most important `guest` व्यक्तित्व और भूमिका-स्थानीय पहुंच, टीएलएस और एचएसटीएस दावे बिना शर्त चलाते हैं।."

# libretranslate
msgid "The journey itself is not dropped. [`files/playwright/test-native-login.js`](./files/playwright/test-native-login.js) drives both personas through Funkwhale's own chain: `/login`, the Keycloak round trip whenever the proxy gates that route, then Funkwhale's own sign-in form, an authenticated-surface assertion, and sign-out back to the anonymous state. It is skipped when `services.ldap.enabled` is false, because no persona holds a Funkwhale account in that variant. The `guest` persona and the baseline assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "स्वयं यात्रा नहीं हुई। [`files/playwright/test-native-login.js`](./files/playwright/test-native-login.js) दोनों व्यक्तियों के माध्यम से ड्राइव Funkwhaleअपनी श्रृंखला: `/login`, Keycloak जब भी प्रॉक्सी गेट्स जो रूट करते हैं, तब राउंड ट्रिप Funkwhale'अपने साइन-इन फॉर्म, एक प्रामाणिक-सतह दावा, और साइन-आउट को गुमनाम राज्य में वापस करने के लिए। जब इसे छोड़ दिया जाता है `services.ldap.enabled` झूठा है क्योंकि कोई व्यक्ति नहीं रखता है Funkwhale उस संस्करण में खाता है। The The most of the most important `guest` व्यक्तित्व और बेसलाइन दावे बिना शर्त चलाते हैं।."

# libretranslate
msgid "The journey itself is not dropped. ```files/playwright/test-admin-native.js`` <./files/playwright/test-admin-native.js>`__ drives it through Shopware’s own selectors: an authenticated backend assertion, then logout through the user-actions toggle and back to the login form. ``SSO_SERVICE_ENABLED`` selects how it signs in — through the ``a.heptacom-admin-open-auth--button`` provider link that AdminOpenAuth appends into ``.sw-login__content`` when SSO is on, through the native password form when it is off. The ``guest`` persona and the role-local reachability, TLS and HSTS assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "स्वयं यात्रा नहीं हुई। ```files/playwright/test-admin-native.js`` <./files/playwright/test-admin-native.js>`__ drives it through Shopware’s own selectors: an authenticated backend assertion, then logout through the user-actions toggle and back to the login form. ``SSO_SERVICE_ENABLED`` selects how it signs in — through the ``a.heptacom-admin-open-auth--button`` provider link that AdminOpenAuth appends into ``.sw-login__content`` when SSO is on, through the native password form when it is off. The ``guest`` व्यक्तित्व और भूमिका-स्थानीय पहुंच, टीएलएस और एचएसटीएस दावे बिना शर्त चलाते हैं।."

# libretranslate
msgid "The journey itself is not dropped. ```files/playwright/test-native-login.js`` <./files/playwright/test-native-login.js>`__ drives both personas through Funkwhale’s own chain: ``/login``, the Keycloak round trip whenever the proxy gates that route, then Funkwhale’s own sign-in form, an authenticated-surface assertion, and sign-out back to the anonymous state. It is skipped when ``services.ldap.enabled`` is false, because no persona holds a Funkwhale account in that variant. The ``guest`` persona and the baseline assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "स्वयं यात्रा नहीं हुई। ```files/playwright/test-native-login.js`` <./files/playwright/test-native-login.js>`__ drives both personas through Funkwhale’s own chain: ``/login``, the Keycloak round trip whenever the proxy gates that route, then Funkwhale’s own sign-in form, an authenticated-surface assertion, and sign-out back to the anonymous state. It is skipped when ``services.ldap.enabled`` is false, because no persona holds a Funkwhale account in that variant. The ``guest`` व्यक्तित्व और बेसलाइन दावे बिना शर्त चलाते हैं।."

