msgid "[ ] `make swarm-playwright role=web-app-openbao` passes the same specs as the compose run. *Not run: `swarm-playwright` requires the staging directory a completed deploy creates, and the `swarm-zombie` drill was cut short by the runner budget on this machine before its Playwright step. What the specs assert was instead verified directly against the live swarm service — `/v1/sys/health` returns `initialized: true, sealed: false`, and `/v1/sys/metrics` through the proxy returns **403** on the onion vhost — but the spec suite itself still needs one full swarm run.*"
