# libretranslate
msgid "[006 - Service-gated Playwright tests](README.md#archive) established the `skipUnlessServiceEnabled(<service>)` contract: scenarios gate on `<SERVICE>_SERVICE_ENABLED` flags so a deploy with `disable=<service>` reports `skipped` instead of `failed`. [004 - Generic RBAC auto-provisioning](README.md#archive) plus [017 - Biber RBAC coverage](017-playwright-biber-rbac-coverage.md) extend that contract to RBAC-aware non-admin scenarios."
msgstr "[006 - सेवा-gated Playwright परीक्षण](README.md#archive) स्थापित `skipUnlessServiceEnabled(<service>)` अनुबंध: परिदृश्य पर गेट `<SERVICE>_SERVICE_ENABLED` इसलिए झंडे के साथ एक तैनाती `disable=<service>` रिपोर्ट `skipped` इसके बजाय `failed`। [004 - जेनरिक RBAC ऑटो-प्रोविजनिंग](README.md#archive) प्लस [017 - बिबर RBAC कवरेज](017-playwright-biber-rbac-coverage.md) RBAC-aware गैर व्यवस्थापक परिदृश्यों के लिए अनुबंध का विस्तार।."

