msgid "`docker stack deploy` does NOT understand compose's `restart:` keys (`no`, `always`, `unless-stopped`, `on-failure[:N]`). It uses a disjoint set of `condition:` values: `none`, `on-failure`, `any`. Translating between the two used to be inline Jinja in ``roles/sys-svc-container/templates/deploy.yml.j2`` -- this filter pulls it out so the call site reads as a single expression and is unit-testable."
