# libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd's only HTTP surface is `ejabberd_web_admin` on `/admin` (see [`templates/configuration.yml.j2`](./templates/configuration.yml.j2)). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. `acl.admin` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; the `guest` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "ejabberd की एकमात्र HTTP सतह है `ejabberd_web_admin` पर `/admin` (देखें [`templates/configuration.yml.j2`](./templates/configuration.yml.j2))यह HTTP बेसिक पर LDAP के खिलाफ एक नंगे JID को प्रमाणित करता है, इसलिए कोई नहीं है Keycloak क्लिक करने के लिए, ग्राहक प्रमाणीकरण स्वयं बंदरगाहों पर चलता है 5222/5269 और Playwright पाश के बाहर रहता है, जैसा कि वॉच पॉइंट्स के तहत बताया गया है। `acl.admin` इसके अलावा केवल व्यवस्थापक JID को सूचीबद्ध करता है, इसलिए वेब व्यवस्थापक हर दूसरे खाते को सीधे मना कर देता है। [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) इसलिए घोषणा `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` और `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; `guest` व्यक्तित्व और बेसलाइन पहुंच दावे बिना शर्त चलाते हैं।."

# libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd’s ``mod_admin`` HTTP UI is the only Playwright-testable surface; XMPP client login itself runs over 5222/5269 and MUST be exercised by an XMPP-aware client outside the Playwright test loop."
msgstr "ज़बरदस्त ``mod_admin`` HTTP UI एकमात्र Playwright-testable सतह है; XMPP क्लाइंट लॉग इन स्वयं चल रहा है 5222/5269 और MUST एक द्वारा प्रयोग किया जाना चाहिए XMPPPlaywright परीक्षण लूप के बाहर क्लाइंट को सुरक्षित रखें।."

# libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd’s only HTTP surface is ``ejabberd_web_admin`` on ``/admin`` (see ```templates/configuration.yml.j2`` <./templates/configuration.yml.j2>`__). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. ``acl.admin`` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the ``guest`` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "ejabberd की एकमात्र HTTP सतह है ``ejabberd_web_admin`` पर ``/admin`` (देखें ```templates/configuration.yml.j2`` <./templates/configuration.yml.j2>`__). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. ``acl.admin`` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the ``guest`` व्यक्तित्व और बेसलाइन पहुंच दावे बिना शर्त चलाते हैं।."

